    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Windshapers have been hard at work trying to respond to the current crisis on Zephras Isle. We have made several surprising discoveries in our search for the missing wind spirits, and we are developing a plan of action that could help us gain the means to save the island.\r\n\r\nWe'll need strong young adventurers like yourself for this to work however. Please, if you have a moment, let us speak on this further.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Listen to Ayessa",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Listen to what Ayessa Dawnsinger has to say.",
      "title": "A Grand Adventure",
